[I] Perl extension for getting information about a class and its structure

[T] Class::Inspector is a Perl module that provides information about
[T] classes and their structure, e.g. whether a class is installed or
[T] loaded, its file name, and the functions and methods it defines or
[T] inherits.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Class-Inspector

